==Points of Interest==
===Jasmine Rematch===
After clearing [[Mt. Silver]], Jasmine can be found on the southern part of the beach during the [[Time|morning]]. After talking to her, she will appear at the Fighting Arena in [[Vermillion City]] for a [[Gym Leader rematches|rematch]].

